  "예: https://rvn.ex.erci.se/play/r/inevitable": ["e.g. https://rvn.ex.erci.se/play/r/inevitable", "例：https://rvn.ex.erci.se/play/r/inevitable", "例如：https://rvn.ex.erci.se/play/r/inevitable"],
  "예: 글자를 크게 · 표지를 둥글게 · 가사를 가운데로": ["e.g. Bigger text · Rounded cover · Centered lyrics", "例：文字を大きく · 表紙を丸く · 歌詞を中央に", "例如：字放大 · 封面圆角 · 歌词居中"],
  "예: 필연 (Inevitable)": ["e.g. Inevitable", "例：必然 (Inevitable)", "例如：必然 (Inevitable)"],
